Mr. White now knows how to place [b]traps[/b] for his victims! [u]Be careful[/u].

Medium Mode - Mr. White will [u]place a trap[/u] every [b]45[/b] seconds;

Hard Mode - Mr. White will [u]place a trap[/u] every [b]20[/b] seconds;

Impossible Mode - Mr. White will [u]place a trap[/u] every [b]10[/b] seconds;
